#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Sessions <configuration; sessions, sessions; configuration>`"
msgstr ":index:`会话 <configuration; sessions, sessions; configuration>`"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:6
msgid "As of Picard v3 you can save and restore your current workspace state as a session file. Sessions preserve file placement (unclustered, clusters, albums, specific tracks, and standalone recordings), your manual metadata edits, and selected configuration options so you can resume work later."
msgstr ""
"从 Picard v3 开始，您可以将当前工作区状态保存为会话文件。会话会保留文件位置（"
"未聚类、聚类、专辑、特定音轨和独立录音）、手动元数据编辑和选定的配置选项，以"
"便您稍后可以继续工作。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:19
msgid "The following settings determine how the session files are managed:"
msgstr "以下设置决定了会话文件的管理方式："

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:21
msgid "**Sessions directory**"
msgstr "**会话目录**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:23
msgid "The directory where the session files are stored."
msgstr "会话文件存储的目录。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:25
msgid "**Auto-save every N minutes**"
msgstr "**每 N 分钟自动保存**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:27
msgid "The interval in minutes between the times the current session is saved. Sessions will not be automatically saved when the interval is set to 0."
msgstr "当前会话保存的时间间隔（分钟）。当时间间隔设置为 0 时，会话不会自动保存。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:29
msgid "When enabled, Picard periodically saves to the last known session file, or to ``autosave.mbps.gz`` in the sessions folder if no file is known."
msgstr ""
"启用时，Picard 会定期保存到最后一个已知的会话文件，如果没有已知文件，则保存到"
"会话文件夹中的 ``autosave.mbps.gz``。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:31
msgid "**Attempt session backup on unexpected shutdown**"
msgstr "**意外关闭时尝试备份会话**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:33
msgid "When enabled, the system will attempt to save the current session to ``autosave.mbps.gz`` in the sessions folder if Picard is unexpectedly shut down."
msgstr ""
"启用时，如果 Picard 意外关闭，系统将尝试将当前会话保存到会话文件夹中的 "
"``autosave.mbps.gz``。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:35
msgid "**Include MusicBrainz data in saved sessions**"
msgstr "**在保存的会话中包含 MusicBrainz 数据**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:37
msgid "When enabled, the release data for loaded albums will be included in the session information. This will speed up the session restore, and also allows continuing the work offline."
msgstr ""
"启用时，加载的专辑的发行数据将被包含在会话信息中。这将加快会话恢复，并允许离"
"线继续工作。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:39
msgid "**Do not make MusicBrainz requests on restore**"
msgstr "**恢复会话时不进行 MusicBrainz 请求**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:41
msgid "When enabled, requests to MusicBrainz will not be made when restoring the session."
msgstr "启用时，恢复会话时不会进行 MusicBrainz 请求。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:43
msgid "**Load last saved session on startup**"
msgstr "**启动时加载上次保存的会话**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:45
msgid "When enabled, Picard will load the most recently used session at startup (if the session information file is still available)."
msgstr "启用时，Picard 启动时会加载最近使用的会话（如果会话信息文件仍然可用）。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:47
msgid "**No auto-matching on load**"
msgstr "**加载时不自动匹配**"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:49
msgid "When enabled, Picard will not perform any MBID-based auto-matching when restoring the session."
msgstr "启用时，Picard 恢复会话时不会执行任何基于 MBID 的自动匹配。"

#: ../../config/options_sessions.rst:53
msgid "For additional information about sessions please see the \":doc:`../usage/sessions`\" section under Usage."
msgstr "有关会话的更多信息，请参阅使用下的 \":doc:`../usage/sessions`\" 部分。"
